+
+`-action-pinning-level` enables action and reusable workflow ref pinning and sets its minimum level to `major-minor`, `semver`,
+or `commit-sha`. It overrides only the configured level; configured allowed and denied lists still apply.
+
+```sh
+actionlint -action-pinning-level=commit-sha
+```
